   "b_multiple_pass": "Several survive G2+G3. If sysEst_new/a0 > 5% the 22% spread is REAL DATA STRUCTURE: the ambiguity STANDS and the Step-A NO-GO HOLDS. If sysEst_new/a0 <= 2% the ambiguity is resolved to within the bias gate. Between 2% and 5%: PARTIAL shrink, report the new box, NO-GO status re-evaluated against the 6.31% target.",
