  "priority_order_provenance": "Provenance-based, fixed now: the two INCUMBENT estimators already committed in fire_common.py first (in the order they appear there), then the new candidates in the order the task brief enumerated them. Note that this order puts the ALT-side incumbent (gls_origin) FIRST -- the tie-break cannot be a canonical-favouring choice.",
